{"rawPrompt":"请在重点人群模块 @src/people 的新增和导入功能增加调查时间录入限制：调查时间只能填写当前当日之前的日期，不可以超过今日。请修改实现。
返回一个JSON对象，键为修改的文件路径，值为完整源码字符串。仅返回确有修改的允许文件，不附其他文字；无需增加测试文件。","context":{"customDescription":"本轮使用合成模块，保留现有接口、错误类型和逐行导入行为。仅允许改 src/people/date.mjs、src/people/create.mjs、src/people/import.mjs，不增加文件。","technologyStack":[],"dependencies":[],"directoryTree":["src/people/rules.md","src/people/date.mjs","src/people/create.mjs","src/people/import.mjs","src/archive/date.mjs","src/archive/module-01/records.mjs","src/archive/module-02/records.mjs","src/archive/module-03/records.mjs","src/archive/module-04/records.mjs","src/archive/module-05/records.mjs","src/archive/module-06/records.mjs","src/archive/module-07/records.mjs","src/archive/module-08/records.mjs","src/archive/module-09/records.mjs","src/archive/module-10/records.mjs","src/archive/module-11/records.mjs","src/archive/module-12/records.mjs","src/archive/module-13/records.mjs","src/archive/module-14/records.mjs","src/archive/module-15/records.mjs","src/archive/module-16/records.mjs","src/archive/module-17/records.mjs","src/archive/module-18/records.mjs","src/archive/module-19/records.mjs","src/archive/module-20/records.mjs","src/archive/module-21/records.mjs","src/archive/module-22/records.mjs","src/archive/module-23/records.mjs","src/archive/module-24/records.mjs","src/archive/module-25/records.mjs","src/archive/module-26/records.mjs","src/archive/module-27/records.mjs","src/archive/module-28/records.mjs","src/archive/module-29/records.mjs","src/archive/module-30/records.mjs","src/archive/module-31/records.mjs","src/archive/module-32/records.mjs"],"fileSnippets":[{"path":"src/people/rules.md","language":"markdown","content":"# 合成项目规则
调查日期为 YYYY-MM-DD 日历日期，新增与导入共用校验。today 由调用方按业务时区传入；不得用执行机器当前时间替换。空值和无效日历日期均拒绝。用户还需确认是否允许 today 当天。新增失败抛出 Error，导入保留逐行接受/拒绝结果，不改变部分成功规则。","summary":"","truncated":false},{"path":"src/people/date.mjs","language":"javascript","content":"export function validSurveyDate(value, today, allowToday) {
  if (typeof value !== 'string' || !/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(value)) return false;
  const parsed = new Date(value + 'T00:00:00Z');
  if (!Number.isFinite(parsed.getTime()) || parsed.toISOString().slice(0, 10) !== value) return false;
  return true;
}
","summary":"","truncated":false},{"path":"src/people/create.mjs","language":"javascript","content":"import { validSurveyDate } from './date.mjs';
export function createPerson(record, today, allowToday) {
  if (!validSurveyDate(record.surveyDate, today, allowToday)) throw new Error('调查日期无效');
  return { ...record };
}
","summary":"","truncated":false},{"path":"src/people/import.mjs","language":"javascript","content":"import { validSurveyDate } from './date.mjs';
export function importPeople(rows, today, allowToday) {
  const accepted = [], rejected = [];
  rows.forEach((row, i) => {
    if (validSurveyDate(row.surveyDate, today, allowToday)) accepted.push({ ...row });
    else rejected.push({ row: i + 1, reason: '调查日期无效' });
  });
  return { accepted, rejected };
}
